ency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=frhknThy8D4Q7kNvwFWa_I5&_nc_oc=AdotDZ0p7n0QKj2UFTdbeuCsz04p35WifnFENbJlat0NROo8b9hy_KIF-RgpElJ0kgw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7OU8MmoKRad2oSW_zXd8mRX6DXZ_B0DBcYq1eYJAzCHQ&oe=6A1EDB39"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OMJ26Bm1EZkQ7kNvwFfqwG7&_nc_oc=Adqse8BfGJdwdz-NkdU2lTdy_9Z-jmsLPC2Hb1H9YjNUahm3EH4fuidDL-rM-9BQo-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6cmLoGRnQjibPu5PkAG7c05eDS-CMBGjflVWBA69qeKQ&oe=6A1EC98F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zBN3Pfa4ZQwQ7kNvwFfiATG&_nc_oc=AdoByrXC_29TXtoGUHqztdAasM2tJK5qgdpP9ViTrFB6aBUPUqUL9WU3pfRInBZ2fGY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6GKyXVRK10jV6xz1vILRkmCXb7DenQvoRh-FJrsoUZWA&oe=6A1ED76E"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squa